    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the storm isn't passing. it's just what's left. people look at me and they see a joke, or worse, they look right through me. you can't \"recover\" from being a pariah. there's nothing to rebuild when the foundation is just... ash. i just feel so tired of trying to pretend there's a version of me that still matters.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
